msgid "Processes D to H implement a data sharing agreement (DSA) between a data provider and a data recipient. Each one is a technical process from the DSA process analysis for <a0>folio-assistant#2702</a0> (P4, P5, P11, P12 and P13). The owner chose this IG as their home on 2026-10-30 (19:59Z). They apply to every agreement, whether it is computable (a W3C ODRL 2.2 {code0} derived from the legal text) or document-only (a signed PDF). The only difference is where the access rule comes from: the ODRL {code1}, or a configuration an administrator sets by hand from the PDF."
msgstr "流程 D 至 H 实施数据提供方与数据接收方之间的数据共享协议 (DSA). 每个流程都是 <a0>folio-assistant#2702</a0> 的 DSA 流程分析中的一个技术流程 (P4, P5, P11, P12 和 P13). 所有者于 2026-10-30 (19:59Z) 选择本 IG 作为其归属. 这些流程适用于每一项协议, 无论其为可计算的 (从法律文本派生的 W3C ODRL 2.2 {code0}) 还是仅文档的 (已签署的 PDF). 唯一的区别在于访问规则的来源: ODRL {code1}, 或管理员根据 PDF 手动设置的配置."

