msgid "The {code0} from SSRAA (UDAP) registration ({code1}, {code2}), the {code3} certificate chain of the JWT client assertion, and the certificate's SAN URI. The {code4} extension (SSRAA §5.2.1.1) adds {code5} and {code6}"
msgstr "SSRAA (UDAP) 注册中的 {code0} ({code1}, {code2}), JWT 客户端断言的 {code3} 证书链, 以及证书的 SAN URI。该 {code4} 扩展 (SSRAA §5.2.1.1) 增加 {code5} 和 {code6}"

#. Source: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:288
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/business-processes.html
#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:288
msgid "The agreement is found from the receiver's verified identity (option A). The Sharer authenticates the receiver with the VHL option in use, then maps that identity to the agreement(s) it holds with that receiver. No token naming the agreement is required."
msgstr "通过接收方经验证的身份查找协议（选项 A）。共享方使用当前采用的 VHL 选项对接收方进行认证，然后将该身份映射到其与该接收方之间持有的协议。无需指明协议的令牌。"

#. Source: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:206
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/business-processes.html
#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:206
msgid "The agreement's fixed-version URL (its ODRL {code0}), or the Consent's URL with {code1}"
msgstr "协议的固定版本 URL (其 ODRL {code0}), 或 Consent 的 URL, 附带 {code1}"

#. Source: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:102
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/business-processes.html
#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:102
msgid "The agreement's fixed-version URL. Each agreement version is published at an immutable URL, with its SHA-256, and catalogued as a DCAT 3 {code0} with {code1} (DCAT 3 §6.8, §6.8.20). For a computable agreement this URL is also the ODRL {code2}. Tokens, grants, Consents and audit records cite this URL, never a \"latest\" URL."
msgstr "协议的固定版本 URL。每个协议版本都发布在一个不可变的 URL 上，附带其 SHA-256，并编目为 DCAT 3 {code0} 并附 {code1} (DCAT 3 §6.8, §6.8.20)。对于可计算的协议，该 URL 也是 ODRL {code2}。令牌、授权许可、Consent 和审计记录均引用该 URL，绝不引用“最新”URL。"

#. Source: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:191
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/business-processes.html
#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:191
msgid "The consent path follows consent rules 1, 2 and 4 under process A. An agreement carries {code0} only when consent is its legal basis. The harness's non-strict mode, which allows {code1} and logs it, must not be used on data gated by an agreement."
msgstr "同意路径遵循流程 A 下的同意规则 1、2 和 4。仅当同意是协议的法律依据时，协议才携带 {code0}。框架 (harness) 的非严格模式允许 {code1} 并记录日志，该模式不得用于受协议管控的数据。"

#. Source: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:234
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/business-processes.html
#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:234
msgid "The decision used, default or replacement, is recorded in the ATNA event and the PROV-O record by its DMN {code0} and decision {code1} and by its file's fixed-version URL and SHA-256. That is the same way an agreement is cited, since DMN 1.5 {code2} has no version element of its own."
msgstr "所使用的决策（默认或替换）在 ATNA 事件和 PROV-O 记录中通过其 DMN {code0} 和决策 {code1}，以及其文件的固定版本 URL 和 SHA-256 记录。这与引用协议的方式相同，因为 DMN 1.5 {code2} 没有自身的版本元素。"

#. Source: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:328
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/business-processes.html
#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:328
msgid "The DID URL in {code0} of a self-issued W3C VC with a {code1}"
msgstr "自签发 W3C VC 的 {code0} 中的 DID URL，该 VC 带有 {code1}"

#. Source: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:14
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/business-processes.html
#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:14
msgid "The following table summarizes the three BPMN 2.0 consent and Verifiable Health Link business processes defined in this Implementation Guide. The data sharing agreement processes are summarized in their own section below."
msgstr "下表汇总了本实施指南中定义的三个 BPMN 2.0 同意与可验证健康链接业务流程。数据共享协议流程在下文单独一节中汇总。"

#. Source: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:413
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/business-processes.html
#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:413
msgid "The holder decides who may see what, for what purpose and for how long (provision.actor, provision.purpose, provision.period)."
msgstr "持有人决定谁可以出于什么目的、在多长时间内查看哪些内容（provision.actor、provision.purpose、provision.period）。"

#. Source: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:287
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/business-processes.html
#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:287
msgid "The link carries no agreement. The VHL payload has no reference to an agreement and needs none. The person who shares the link does not bind the receiver to anything."
msgstr "链接不携带协议。VHL 载荷不引用任何协议，也无需引用。共享链接的人不会使接收方受任何约束。"

#. Source: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:335
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/business-processes.html
#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:335
msgid "The lookup has no standard element. No existing VHL, OAuth or VC element maps a verified receiver to an agreement. The mapping is the Sharer's own configuration, keyed by the agreement's fixed-version URL, the same configuration as {code0}. No field is invented."
msgstr "查找没有标准元素。现有的 VHL、OAuth 或 VC 元素都无法将已验证的接收方映射到协议。该映射是共享方自身的配置，以协议的固定版本 URL 为键，与 {code0} 的配置相同。未发明任何字段。"

#. Source: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:208
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/business-processes.html
#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:208
msgid "The policy's ODRL 2.2 {code0}, or null when it declares none"
msgstr "策略的 ODRL 2.2 {code0}, 未声明时为 null"

#. Source: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:254
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/business-processes.html
#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:254
msgid "The Provenance Log and the ATNA Audit Record Repository are data stores, not lanes, because they only keep what the audit writers send (smart-trust-phw#22):"
msgstr "溯源日志和 ATNA 审计记录存储库是数据存储而不是泳道，因为它们只保存审计写入方发送的内容（smart-trust-phw#22）："

#. Source: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:291
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/business-processes.html
#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:291
msgid "The receiver MAY name agreements. With the OAuth with SSRAA option, the receiver can list one or more fixed-version URLs in {code0} of the {code1} extension (SSRAA §5.2.1.1, an optional array of policy URIs). On the server-to-server route of process E it can list them in {code2} (RFC 9396 §2.2). Naming narrows the permissions the receiver acts under, and never escapes another applicable agreement's prohibition. With the Verifiable Credential Option, the receiver names the policies it acts under in the credential's W3C VC 2.0 {code3} (§5.5), one <a0>{code4}</a0> entry per policy: {code5}. The policy is a code in a GDHCN <a1>Trust Domain</a1>'s terms-of-use ValueSet, and the Sharer finds the Trust Domain from the ValueSet that holds it (owner, 2026-11-01, card Q-VC-2). Naming is optional, so requests signed with HTTP Message Signatures, which have no field for it, still work."
msgstr "接收方可以（MAY）指明协议。采用 OAuth with SSRAA 选项时，接收方可以在 {code1} 扩展的 {code0} 中列出一个或多个固定版本 URL (SSRAA §5.2.1.1，一个可选的策略 URI 数组)。在流程 E 的服务器到服务器路径上，它可以在 {code2} 中列出这些 URL (RFC 9396 §2.2)。指明协议会收窄接收方所依据的权限，且绝不能规避另一项适用协议的禁止。采用 Verifiable Credential Option（可验证凭证选项）时，接收方在凭证的 W3C VC 2.0 {code3} (§5.5) 中指明其所依据的策略，每项策略一个 <a0>{code4}</a0> 条目: {code5}。该策略是 GDHCN <a1>信任域</a1>使用条款 ValueSet 中的一个代码，共享方根据持有该代码的 ValueSet 找到信任域（所有者，2026-11-01，卡片 Q-VC-2）。指明是可选的，因此使用 HTTP Message Signatures 签名的请求（其没有用于此的字段）仍然有效。"

#. Source: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:416
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/business-processes.html
#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:416
msgid "The registry copy is the one enforced (processes C, F, I)."
msgstr "强制执行的是登记库副本（流程 C、F、I）。"

#. Source: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:202
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/business-processes.html
#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:202
msgid "The rule is the OMG DMN 1.5 decision {code0} in {code1}. DMN 1.5 (namespace {code2}) is the version of the WHO SMART DAK decision tables, and the expressions are FEEL. Its {code3} links it to {code4} and {code5}. Its one input, {code6}, has one row per agreement or Consent evaluated:"
msgstr "该规则是 {code1} 中的 OMG DMN 1.5 决策 {code0}。DMN 1.5 (命名空间 {code2}) 是世卫组织（WHO）SMART DAK 决策表所用的版本，表达式采用 FEEL。其 {code3} 将其链接到 {code4} 和 {code5}。其唯一的输入, {code6}, 对所评估的每项协议或 Consent 各有一行:"

#. Source: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:412
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/business-processes.html
#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:412
msgid "The text is the definition of the consent code in the trust domain's terms-of-use code system, at the version shown, in the holder's language. For Hajj: IPS.HAJJ.CONSENT, for example CONSENT-MYS at 2.1.0."
msgstr "该文本是信任域使用条款代码系统中同意代码的定义，采用所示版本，并以持有人的语言呈现。对于 Hajj：IPS.HAJJ.CONSENT，例如 2.1.0 版的 CONSENT-MYS。"

#. Source: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:285
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/business-processes.html
#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:285
msgid "The VHL Sharer is the organisation or system that holds the documents. It may already have a data sharing agreement with the organisation or application that receives a VHL. When that receiver resolves the link ({code0} Retrieve Manifest, then {code1}), the Sharer decides the request under that agreement. It uses the same decision as process F, audits as process G does, and revokes as process H does. The owner set this case on 2026-10-30 (20:01Z and 20:04Z):"
msgstr "VHL 共享方是持有文档的组织或系统。它可能已与接收 VHL 的组织或应用签有数据共享协议。当该接收方解析链接 ({code0} Retrieve Manifest, 然后 {code1}) 时，共享方依据该协议对请求作出决定。它使用与流程 F 相同的决策，按流程 G 的方式审计，并按流程 H 的方式撤销。所有者于 2026-10-30（20:01Z 和 20:04Z）设定了这一情形："

#. Source: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:414
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/business-processes.html
#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:414
msgid "The wallet confirmation or the signed form (a DocumentReference or QuestionnaireResponse): the Consent's source[x]."
msgstr "钱包确认或签名表单（DocumentReference 或 QuestionnaireResponse）：Consent 的 source[x]。"

#. Source: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:343
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/business-processes.html
#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:343
msgid "These two processes are shared blocks for any certificate type (BPMN reuse proposal, Q-BPMN-1 A). A trust domain or another IG calls them instead of copying their steps. Their steps come from the smart-icvp issuing and verifying diagrams."
msgstr "这两个流程是适用于任何证书类型的共享块（BPMN 复用提案，Q-BPMN-1 A）。信任域或其他 IG 调用它们，而不是复制其步骤。其步骤来自 smart-icvp 的签发和验证流程图。"

#. Source: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:1
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/business-processes.html
#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:1
msgid "This page describes the core business processes and workflows for the Personal Health Wallet (PHW) Implementation Guide, integrating IHE IT Infrastructure Privacy Consent on FHIR (PCF) v1.1.0 ({code0}) and IHE IT Infrastructure Verifiable Health Links (VHL) v1.0.0-comment ({code1})."
msgstr "本页描述个人健康钱包（PHW）实施指南的核心业务流程和工作流，整合了 IHE IT Infrastructure Privacy Consent on FHIR (PCF) v1.1.0 ({code0}) 和 IHE IT Infrastructure Verifiable Health Links (VHL) v1.0.0-comment ({code1})。"

#. Source: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:10
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/business-processes.html
#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:10
msgid "Three-Valued Consent Decision and PROV-O Provenance: During VHL redemption (Process C), patient privacy consent directives retrieved via {code0} are translated to W3C ODRL 2.2 policies ({code1}) and evaluated via three-valued {code2} ({code3} | {code4} | {code5}), recording a W3C PROV-O {code6} citing {code7} and {code8}."
msgstr "三值同意决策与 PROV-O 溯源: 在 VHL 兑现期间（流程 C），通过 {code0} 检索到的患者隐私同意指令被转换为 W3C ODRL 2.2 策略 ({code1})，并通过三值 {code2} ({code3} | {code4} | {code5}) 进行评估，同时记录一条 W3C PROV-O {code6}, 引用 {code7} 和 {code8}。"

