#. Source: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:140
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/business-processes.html
#: input/pagecontent/business-processes.md:140
msgid "UDAP route (owner approval, 2026-10-30 20:28Z). UDAP is used as profiled by HL7 Security for Scalable Registration, Authentication, and Authorization (SSRAA), {code0} 2.0.0 (STU 2, canonical {code1}), the IG that VHL's OAuth with SSRAA Option names. Its trust is X.509: the client's certificate chains to an anchor of a trust community, so a national X.509 PKI can serve as the anchor without GDHCN. SSRAA section numbers were read from the IG source ({code2}, tag {code3}, commit {code4}): they follow its page order, and they agree with the IG's own cross-references, which is also how ITI-YY5 cites them (\"SSRAA Sections 2 and 3\", \"Section 5.2.1\"). The rendered pages at hl7.org were not reachable to check. SSRAA 2.0.0 is US realm; the source's {code5} branch now builds a universal-realm successor, {code6} 3.0.0 (STU 3 post-ballot CI build), not yet published. ‡ marks a section of a UDAP.org specification (UDAP Dynamic Client Registration STU1, UDAP Server Metadata STU1, UDAP JWT-Based Client Authentication STU1) as SSRAA links it; udap.org was not reachable to check it."
msgstr "UDAP 路径（所有者批准，2026-10-30 20:28Z）。UDAP 按 HL7 Security for Scalable Registration, Authentication, and Authorization (SSRAA), {code0} 2.0.0 (STU 2, 规范地址 {code1}) 的规定使用，即 VHL 的 OAuth with SSRAA Option 所指明的 IG。其信任基于 X.509：客户端证书链接到某个信任社区的信任锚，因此国家 X.509 PKI 可以在没有 GDHCN 的情况下充当信任锚。SSRAA 章节编号读自该 IG 源码 ({code2}, 标签 {code3}, 提交 {code4}): 它们遵循其页面顺序，并与该 IG 自身的交叉引用一致，ITI-YY5 也正是这样引用它们的（\"SSRAA Sections 2 and 3\"、\"Section 5.2.1\"）。hl7.org 上的渲染页面无法访问，未能核对。SSRAA 2.0.0 适用于美国（US）领域；源码的 {code5} 分支现在构建的是通用领域的后继版本, {code6} 3.0.0 (STU 3 投票后 CI 构建)，尚未发布。‡ 标记 UDAP.org 规范中的章节（UDAP Dynamic Client Registration STU1、UDAP Server Metadata STU1、UDAP JWT-Based Client Authentication STU1），按 SSRAA 的链接方式引用；udap.org 无法访问，未能核对。"

