#. Source: input/pagecontent/consent.md:1
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/consent.html
#: input/pagecontent/consent.md:1
msgid "This page describes how a Personal Health Wallet handles consent. Consent follows IHE Privacy Consent on FHIR (PCF) 1.1.0. Each trust domain sets the consent policies that apply in it. The processes on this page are trust-anchor neutral: GDHCN is one possible trust anchor among others."
msgstr "本页描述个人健康钱包如何处理同意。同意遵循 IHE Privacy Consent on FHIR (PCF) 1.1.0。每个信任域设定其中适用的同意策略。本页中的流程对信任锚保持中立：GDHCN 是众多可能的信任锚之一。"

