msgid "Registration. With the OAuth with SSRAA option, KSA's EMR registers with the origin HIE by UDAP (HL7 SSRAA), using a certificate that chains to an anchor of the {code0} trust domain. With HTTP Message Signatures, nothing is registered: the origin reads KSA's key from the trust list. No agreement URL is involved."
msgstr "注册。采用 OAuth with SSRAA 选项时，KSA 的 EMR 通过 UDAP（HL7 SSRAA）向来源 HIE 注册，所用证书链接到 {code0} 信任域的一个信任锚。采用 HTTP Message Signatures 时无需注册：来源国从信任列表中读取 KSA 的密钥。不涉及任何协议 URL。"

