msgstr "本实施指南仍在开发中。其内容仅用于演示目的。 {:.stu-note}"

#. Source: input/pagecontent/index.md:7
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/index.html
#: input/pagecontent/index.md:7
msgid "This implementation guide specifies how a Personal Health Wallet (PHW) lets a person record privacy consent, share health information through verifiable health links, and have that consent enforced when the information is used. It uses IHE Privacy Consent on FHIR (PCF) 1.1.0 for consent directives and IHE Verifiable Health Links (VHL) 1.0.0-comment for the links."
msgstr "本实施指南规定个人健康钱包（PHW）如何让个人记录隐私同意、通过可验证健康链接共享健康信息，并在信息被使用时执行该同意。它使用 IHE Privacy Consent on FHIR（PCF）1.1.0 表示同意指令，使用 IHE Verifiable Health Links（VHL）1.0.0-comment 表示链接。"

