msgstr "困扰"

#. Source: input/pagecontent/personas.md:101
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/personas.html
#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:101
msgid "Goal. Issue certificates that are accepted wherever his patients go, without extra paperwork."
msgstr "目标。签发在其患者所到之处都被接受的证书，无需额外的文书工作。"

#. Source: input/pagecontent/personas.md:48
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/personas.html
#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:48
msgid "Goal. Read a visitor's record quickly and know it is genuine and that she is allowed to read it."
msgstr "目标。快速读取来访者的记录，并确认记录真实、她有权读取。"

#. Source: input/pagecontent/personas.md:31
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/personas.html
#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:31
msgid "Goal. Register only the clients an agreement allows, and revoke them the moment it ends."
msgstr "目标。只注册协议允许的客户端，并在协议终止时立即撤销它们。"

#. Source: input/pagecontent/personas.md:82
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/personas.html
#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:82
msgid "Goal. Share her health information only with the people who need it, for as long as they need it."
msgstr "目标。只与需要的人共享她的健康信息，且仅在其需要期间共享。"

#. Source: input/pagecontent/personas.md:65
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/personas.html
#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:65
msgid "Goal. Show, for any access, which consent and which agreement allowed it."
msgstr "目标。对任何一次访问，都能说明是哪项同意和哪项协议允许了它。"

#. Source: input/pagecontent/personas.md:9
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/personas.html
#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:9
