msgstr "保存同意指令并响应 IHE PCF [ITI-108] Access Consent。是 ActorDefinition ConsentRegistry 的特化 (input/fsh/actors/actors.fsh)。"

#. Source: input/pagecontent/personas.md:12
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/personas.html
#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:12
msgid "Holds the health information, generates verifiable health links, and enforces consent when a link is redeemed. Specializes the ActorDefinition Issuer (input/fsh/actors/actors.fsh)."
msgstr "保存健康信息，生成可验证健康链接，并在链接被兑现时执行同意。是 ActorDefinition Issuer 的特化 (input/fsh/actors/actors.fsh)。"

#. Source: input/pagecontent/personas.md:116
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust-phw/personas.html
#: input/pagecontent/personas.md:116
msgid "Home health information exchange"
msgstr "本国健康信息交换平台"

